sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant A as Job API
    participant D as Database
    participant W as Worker
    participant Rp as Reaper
    C->>A: POST /jobs {imageRef, ops, idempotencyKey}
    A->>D: INSERT job state=PENDING (unique on idempotency key)
    A-->>C: 202 jobId
    W->>D: claim — one conditional UPDATE, FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    D-->>W: RUNNING with owner and leaseUntil
    Note over W,D: ownership is a lease, not a lock — it expires without anyone alive
    W->>W: validate the header before decoding, hard memory and time caps
    W->>D: heartbeat, guarded by owner AND state
    W->>D: complete WHERE owner=me AND state=RUNNING
    Note over W,D: zero rows updated means ownership was lost — discard the work
    Rp->>D: expired lease → back to PENDING, attempts already incremented
    Rp->>D: attempts ≥ 3 → FAILED with the last error
